## 4. kind limitation in THIS sandbox (documented honestly)
  kind create cluster fails at kubeadm init: kubelet cannot start pod sandboxes;
  runc create ... 'can't get final child's PID from pipe: EOF' (nested runtime on
  cgroup v1 + kernel 6.18.44-fc-v64). Reproduced with node images v1.31 (runc 1.1.13)
  and v1.34 (runc 1.3.0) -> not a runc-version issue; a nesting/cgroup limit of this
  microVM. A normal laptop/server/CI runs kind fine (see scripts/kind-up.sh + CI).

